}

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// ARMS — slim stylised kid arm: deltoid (under the sleeve), biceps / triceps, a real elbow (olecranon point,
// epicondyles, crease hollow), brachioradialis swell, tapering flattened forearm, wrist with the ulnar head.
